/*
Expected output:
inner check
inner always
outer always
returned 3

A return inside a check block that is itself inside another check block.
Both have always blocks. The inner always block runs first, then the outer
one, each exactly once, and then the value reaches the caller.

Each check block has a detect block that is never reached, so this tests
the return, not the separate problem with an always block that has no
detect block.
*/

class Main
    action Main
        output "returned " + GetValue()
    end

    action GetValue returns integer
        check
            check
                output "inner check"
                return 3
            detect e
                output "inner detect"
            always
                output "inner always"
            end
        detect e
            output "outer detect"
        always
            output "outer always"
        end
        return 0
    end
end
